       "from": [
        "S01-B1"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B1"
      },
      {
       "text": "悬在半空",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B1"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B1"
      },
      {
       "text": "停顿等着回声",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B1"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B1"
      },
      {
       "text": "短句像叹息",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B2"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B2"
      },
      {
       "text": "刚冒出就被截断",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B2"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B2"
      },
      {
       "text": "余音散在冷空气里",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B2"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B2"
      },
      {
       "text": "像从漫长昏沉醒来",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "视线还模糊",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "颤抖着伸出手",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "摸到的只有虚空",
       "keys": [],
       "from": [
        "S01-B3"
       ],
       "bead": "S01-B3"
      },
      {
       "text": "还没哭出来",
